Specifically, the following are DERIVED FROM LOLRMM data (the catalogue served at
https://lolrmm.io/api/rmm_tools.json):

  * policy/*.xml and policy/variants/*.xml
      Windows App Control policies whose signer rules are computed from the
      code-signing certificates LOLRMM publishes in
      CodeSigning.certificates[].certificate_der_base64.

  * policy/signers.csv, policy/skipped-signers.csv, policy/summary.txt
      The generated rule inventory, produced from the same catalogue.

  * the output of src/eset/Get-LolrmmUrlList.v*.ps1 and
    src/eset/Get-LolrmmHipsList.v*.ps1
      ESET website-block lists and HIPS path lists generated from the catalogue's
      Artifacts.Network / Artifacts.InstallPaths fields.

  * the vendor name, tool name, issuer and certificate-metadata columns carried in
    the above files.

The upstream catalogue file itself (rmm_tools.json) is NOT redistributed in this
repository; it is downloaded at build time by src/appcontrol/Build-RmmAppControl.

The catalogue this repository was built from is identified by hash in
policy/summary.txt.

