Microsoft
================================================================================

The App Control policies are built on Microsoft's example policy template
%windir%\schemas\CodeIntegrity\ExamplePolicies\AllowAll.xml and follow the layout
Microsoft documents for its recommended block rules. No Microsoft file is
redistributed here.

